WEBVTT

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:00.975
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:03.349 --> 00:00:04.321
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me?

00:00:04.955 --> 00:00:05.457
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes?

00:00:06.052 --> 00:00:08.094
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is there a coffee shop near here?

00:00:08.776 --> 00:00:13.535
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, there’s one in South Street. It’s next to the cinema, on the right.

00:00:14.091 --> 00:00:14.784
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:18.130
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.681
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me. Is there a Chinese restaurant near here?

00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:28.049
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, there’s one in King Street, between the bank and the gym.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:29.720
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thank you.

00:00:32.411 --> 00:00:33.065
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:38.167
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me. Is there a phone shop near here?

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:43.955
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, there’s one in North Street, next to the hotel, on the left.

00:00:44.455 --> 00:00:44.966
<v><b>A:</b></v> Thanks.

00:00:47.283 --> 00:00:47.881
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:49.294 --> 00:00:51.583
<v><b>A:</b></v> Excuse me. Where’s the park?

00:00:52.337 --> 00:00:55.374
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s in London Road, opposite the gym.

00:00:55.834 --> 00:00:57.381
<v><b>A:</b></v> Oh, great. Thank you.